| !Run for !ReelEGL (Reel drawing through riscos-mesa's EGL)
| Puts ReelEGL on the icon bar. Drop a video on it, or double-click a video
| in the Filer while ReelEGL is loaded. %*0 = a file to play at once.
Set ReelEGL$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <ReelEGL$Dir>.!Sprites

RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error ReelEGL needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error ReelEGL needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| Threads: the thread timer of UnixLib 5.0.1 (which ReelEGL is built with)
| runs from the PThreadTicker module when it's loaded: a copy merged into
| !System first, else the one in here. Without it UnixLib uses a copy in
| the RMA, which also works.
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 IfThere System:Modules.PThrTicker Then RMLoad System:Modules.PThrTicker
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 IfThere <ReelEGL$Dir>.PThrTicker Then RMLoad <ReelEGL$Dir>.PThrTicker
| Sound: SharedSoundBuffer, StreamManager and SharedSound (John Duffell's
| ssb.zip, from https://orac.co.uk/software/rdpclient/rdpclient.html). Merged into !System they
| still have to be loaded: these do it (and are quiet if they're missing).
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSound Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSound
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 IfThere System:Modules.StreamMan Then RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSBuffer Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer

| The program is about 37MB (it includes riscos-mesa's EGL and OpenGL);
| its memory for pictures and sound is in a dynamic area ("ReelEGL Heap").
WimpSlot -min 49152K -max 49152K
Run <ReelEGL$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
